        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="open" value="&lt;b&gt;Validate before implementation commitments&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Engine/library vs Glue • model quality/latency • AI-independent compatibility • Standard history vs AI-context retention&lt;br&gt;Approval/callback and S3/DynamoDB consistency • worker timeout/cancellation • API/file limits&lt;br&gt;Active-work expiry coordination • durable-data backup/RPO • numeric quotas and retention windows" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E4;strokeColor=#C88838;fontColor=#172B4D;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;spacing=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
